       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GOTOTEST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PGM PIC X(8).
       01 FLAG PIC X.
       01 WS-X PIC X.
       01 IDX PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MOVE 'PROGA' TO WS-PGM.
       GO TO FIRST-TARGET.
       MOVE 'BADPROG' TO WS-PGM.
       FIRST-TARGET.
       CALL WS-PGM.
       MOVE 'PROGB' TO WS-PGM.
       GO TO SECOND-TARGET.
       MOVE 'BADPROG' TO WS-PGM.
       SECOND-TARGET.
       CALL WS-PGM.
       CALL 'PROGC'.
       GOBACK.
